 "raw": "<|det|>text [112, 124, 943, 335]<|/det|>The organisms in geographical region had to be distributed. A species on the fresh water ecosystem like fresh, prawn are dried due to water pollution. If we pollute the fresh water many species are got disturbed.\n<|det|>text [112, 375, 943, 550]<|/det|>We can use the \"3P\" principle here to reduce the wastes that are made in house. Firstly we have to separate the waste liberated on the degradable matter.\n<|det|>text [120, 583, 955, 748]<|/det|>we can use this composting method to manage the domestic waste, we can use the degradable wastes to feed with animals, berries (poultry), etc...\n<|det|>text [120, 755, 955, 860]<|/det|>It will help to reduce the waste in the environment and do not affect the ecosystem."
